{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e87b","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a08946-5fbe-7830-b2e8-af2616179f48"},"sequence":4760,"recorded_at":1780531400009515,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"b6e8a9ed-35e9-4191-9a50-1dfe1ff8a38f","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"b6e8a9ed-35e9-4191-9a50-1dfe1ff8a38f","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"b6e8a9ed-35e9-4191-9a50-1dfe1ff8a38f"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a08962-7c8a-7bf1-a743-b10fcdb9f6e1"},"task_id":"01a08962-7c8a-7bf1-a743-b10fcdb9f6e1","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a08962-7c8a-7bf1-a743-b10fcdb9f6e1","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-102-1\",\n  \"command\": \"cat >> LOGBOOK.md <<'EOF'\\n\\n## 2026-09-10 (later)\\n\\n### TASK-260909-2ez769 rework — CR3 changes-requested repaired on base a89328c\\n- SCOPE: same candidate, no base move (adoption trunk already in). All five CR3 findings addressed in `internal/hosttrust` + `internal/config`; no RPC absorption (4 tracked RPC paths verified CLEAN, parked 11/11 intact, no rpcwire remnants).\\n- P1 STALE MUTATION: `WithMutationAuthorization` no longer refreshes the cached generation; a binding older than committed refuses `ErrStaleGeneration` (`authorize.go`). Committed `TestWithMutationAuthorizationRefusesStaleGeneration` + narrowing plant `stale-mutation-refresh` (KILLED).\\n- P1 BOUNDARY/REVOKE: lock descriptors are per-acquisition (unix `flock`, Windows `LockFileEx`), so same-process goroutines serialize like separate processes; lock-file creation guarded by a process mutex; `Initialize` no longer re-acquires (unlocked nested read + documented no-reentry discipline). Existing serialization test hardened to the deterministic 250ms contention shape. Narrowing coverage via `revoke-state` + serialization tests.\\n- P1 CRASH ATOMICITY: new joint commit (`joint.go`): closed `PendingCommit` marker, `JointCommit` (in-lock revalidation + marker + replace + bump + unmark), `Recover` (forward/abort/refuse) auto-run by `Open`. `CommitConfigChange` removed (it encoded the split-brain pattern). Apply/rollback revalidate preview/source/generation/custody inside the exclusive hold; post-bump failures restore source + converge via `Recover` (`ErrJointReplacementDurable`). Committed real child-process crash test (`TestApplyV4CrashConvergesGeneration`, exit 77) plus abort/intervention/already-bumped/exhaustion unit tests. Power-loss vs process-crash documented honestly (fsync-durable, disk-dependent).\\n- P1 WINDOWS DACL: `verifyOwner` now audits owner SID plus every DACL allow entry (null/empty/deny-only/unknown-type fail closed); creation paths install protected owner-only DACLs (`secureStaged`); Unix mode checks abstracted via `platformModeOK` (exact 0700/0600 preserved). Pure `ownerOnlyGrants` evaluator tested on darwin (9 cases). No Windows runner exists here: evidence is GOOS=windows build + vet clean, unit tests, and an explicit stated bound (no invented runtime pass).\\n- P2 EXCLUSION: `ExcludedFromReplication` gains the joint marker; new `MatchExcludedFromReplication` (staging prefixes, fail-closed escapes) and `ExcludedConfigDirName` (.bak./.pre-rollback./.ax-config-*) with custody-walk + published-backup-name tests. No in-repo replication/snapshot/export-of-state surface exists (sessadapter/localstore/dirnode do not touch host-channel); outcome hands consumers + required tests to future export surfaces. Config claim corrected: 4 semantic narrowing + 1 label-precision kill (label plant marked LABEL-PRECISION in-table).\\n- ROW 13: new production `LoadCoherent` (config+trust under one shared hold) + serialization test.\\n- VALIDATION (rerun this run, exit 0): gofmt clean; `go vet ./...`; `go test ./... -count=1` all ok (281 top-level PASS across hosttrust/config/peeridentity/secprim); `-cover` hosttrust 77.8 config 93.1 peeridentity 97.5 secprim 94.4; `-race` on hosttrust+config ok; tracecheck ok; catalog v0.6.0 -check ok; linux+windows amd64 builds ok; `git diff --check` clean; refusal-inventory audit green (new sites covered by direct revalidation/helper tests); census green. Mutation batteries rerun exact-source: hosttrust 18 narrowing KILLED + neutral passed; config 4 semantic + 1 label KILLED + neutral passed (manifests bound to a89328c in mutations-*-rework/).\\n- STATUS: ready for review, worktree UNCOMMITTED for handoff snapshot. `task-board validate` shows 231 pre-existing board-wide ledger-mirror issues, none referencing this task.\\nEOF\\necho LOGGED\",\n  \"description\": \"Append logbook rework entry\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"LOGGED\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 7,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 2,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
