{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000eaab","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a08946-5fbe-7830-b2e8-af2616179f48"},"sequence":5040,"recorded_at":1780531400010075,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"b6e8a9ed-35e9-4191-9a50-1dfe1ff8a38f","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"b6e8a9ed-35e9-4191-9a50-1dfe1ff8a38f","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"b6e8a9ed-35e9-4191-9a50-1dfe1ff8a38f"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Ready for review — handed off to review.\n\nAll five CR3 findings were reproduced RED first, then repaired in production code on base `a89328c` (no base move, no RPC absorption — 4 tracked RPC paths verified clean, parked delta intact):\n\n- Stale mutation: `WithMutationAuthorization` now refuses stale bindings with `ErrStaleGeneration` instead of refreshing the cached number.\n- Boundary/revoke: per-acquisition lock descriptors/handles serialize same-process goroutines like separate processes; `Initialize` no longer re-acquires; serialization test hardened to deterministic 250ms contention.\n- Crash atomicity: new joint commit (`PendingCommit` marker, `JointCommit`, `Recover` auto-run by `Open`) with in-lock preview/source/generation/custody revalidation; proven by a real child-process crash test (exit 77, restart converges to 4.0.0/gen+1).\n- Windows DACL: owner-SID plus full allow-entry audit with protected owner-only DACL install; Unix keeps exact 0700/0600. No Windows runner exists here — stated as a bound with cross-build/vet/unit evidence, no invented pass.\n- Exclusion: marker added, new fail-closed matchers with custody-walk and backup-name tests, plus an explicit handoff for future export surfaces; config kill claim corrected to 4 semantic + 1 label-precision.\n\nEvidence: 21/21 AC rows driven (ratio with call sites in the attached outcome `TASK-260909-2ez769_results-rework.md`); 18 hosttrust + 4 config narrowing mutants killed plus 1 label kill, all exact-source with digest manifests; full suite, race, coverage (77.8/93.1/97.5/94.4), tracecheck, catalog check, linux+windows builds, and refusal-inventory audit all green. Checklist 22/22, worktree left uncommitted at the checkpoint for snapshot.","reason":null}}
